  "unterkonzeptCrosswalkStatus": "NOT YET DONE. This taxonomy's Unterkonzept1/Unterkonzept2 tags substantially overlap in subject matter with EvoMentor_DE's Pattern-B files (evolutionskonzepte.json, individuelleentwicklungkonzepte.json, strukturfunktionkonzepte.json, stoffenergiekonzepte.json, informationkommunikationkonzepte.json, steuerungregelungkonzepte.json) but at different granularity, and have not been item-by-item crosswalked -- that is a real semantic-judgment pass (comparable in scope to EvoMentor's own hand-authored PHRASE_CONCEPT_MAP work), disclosed here as a pending backlog rather than silently skipped or force-merged.",
